<!-- ============ 13 ROADMAP ============ -->
<section class="sec" id="roadmap">
 <div class="wrap">
  <span class="lab">13 / The Roadmap</span>
  <h2>The Trojan Horse approach.</h2>
  <div class="rule"></div>
  <p class="nar" style="font-size:1.05rem">We don't launch to consumers first. We launch to businesses. We use B2B to train the institutions, build the legal precedents, and create the operational muscle. Then we open to consumers. Phased. Deliberate. Unstoppable.</p>
  <div class="tl">
   <div class="tl-i rv"><span class="ph">Phase 1 — Months 1–6</span><h3>The B2B Beachhead — Gauteng &amp; Western Cape</h3>
    <p><strong>Target:</strong> Mid-sized law firms, conveyancers, independent estate agencies, private debt collectors. Launch in Sandton, Cape Town CBD, and Pretoria.</p>
    <p><strong>Product:</strong> PresenceOS as a secure web application. Institution staff open a browser tab, run the telepresence session, and upload results to their legacy system. Focus on high-friction tasks: Home Affairs queues, vehicle finance closings, diaspora property inspections.</p>
    <p><strong>Goal:</strong> Prove the workflow. Build case law. Generate cash flow. Train proxies. <strong>Revenue: R50K – R200K/month.</strong></p></div>
   <div class="tl-i rv"><span class="ph">Phase 2 — Months 6–12</span><h3>The API Trojan Horse — Law Firms &amp; Estate Agents</h3>
    <p><strong>Target:</strong> Software vendors that supply banks and dealerships (DMS providers, loan origination platforms). Introduce "Presence for Business."</p>
    <p><strong>Product:</strong> PresenceOS API integrated into their software as a premium add-on.</p>
    <p><strong>Goal:</strong> Become the default remote execution layer inside existing institutional software. You don't sell to the bank — you sell to the software the bank already uses. <strong>Revenue: R500K – R2M/month.</strong></p></div>
   <div class="tl-i rv"><span class="ph">Phase 3 — Months 12–18</span><h3>The Institutional Squeeze — National Scale</h3>
    <p><strong>Target:</strong> Major banks (FNB, Standard Bank, Absa), CCMA, Department of Home Affairs. Expand to Durban, Gqeberha, and regional hubs across all 9 provinces. Launch the "Diaspora Concierge" subscription for South Africans in the UK, Australia, and the UAE.</p>
    <p><strong>Goal:</strong> When a consumer sends a Presence proxy to a bank branch, the clerk already knows what it means. The institutional friction is gone. <strong>Revenue: R2M – R10M/month.</strong></p></div>
   <div class="tl-i rv"><span class="ph">Phase 4 — Months 18+</span><h3>The Consumer Launch &amp; Global Corridor</h3>
    <p><strong>Target:</strong> SA Diaspora, busy professionals, SMEs. Full consumer-facing app. Anyone can book a Presence proxy for any legal, physical task.</p>
    <p><strong>Global:</strong> SADC regional expansion (Namibia, Botswana, Zimbabwe). Digital nomad corridors (Thailand, Bali, Portugal) for visa renewals, condo inspections, bank deposits. A global B2B legal network — a lawyer in New York deploys a Presence agent in Johannesburg. <strong>Revenue: R10M+/month at scale.</strong></p></div>
  </div>

  <span class="lab" style="margin-top:36px">The Moat — Why No One Can Easily Copy This</span>
  <div class="grid g4">
   <div class="card stone rv"><h3>Operational Complexity</h3><p>Training proxies to handle institutional pushback, manage legal escalations, and execute under pressure is not something a gig app can replicate overnight. This is skilled work, not gig work.</p></div>
   <div class="card stone rv"><h3>Legal Precedent</h3><p>Every successful execution builds legal precedent. Every Chain of Custody certificate accepted by a court strengthens our position. This compounds over time.</p></div>
   <div class="card stone rv"><h3>Institutional Integration</h3><p>Once PresenceOS is integrated into a bank's DMS or a dealership's CRM, switching costs are enormous. We become embedded infrastructure, not a vendor.</p></div>
   <div class="card stone rv"><h3>Trust Brand</h3><p>When a clerk sees the Presence badge, they trust it. That trust takes years to build and cannot be bought. It is our most valuable asset.</p></div>
  </div>
 </div>
</section>

