  <h2 style="margin-top:20px">Investors.</h2>
  <p class="nar" style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)">We are raising capital to build South Africa's first legally empowered task marketplace. We have the model. We have the legal framework. We need the fuel.</p>

  <div class="grid g3" style="margin-top:30px">
   <div class="card rv"><h3>The Diaspora</h3><p>Over 1 million South Africans live abroad. They own property, have aging parents, and hold bank accounts back home. They desperately need trusted, insured proxies. They will pay premium rates.</p></div>
   <div class="card rv"><h3>The Bureaucracy</h3><p>South Africans lose millions of hours annually in queues. The willingness-to-pay for a "Spot Holder" is immediate and high. This is a daily pain point with zero current solution.</p></div>
   <div class="card rv"><h3>The Zero-Liability Model</h3><p>Because we don't carry insurance or employ proxies, our operating margins are SaaS-level (70%+), not logistics-level (15–20%). We scale like software, not like a courier company.</p></div>
